                <div class="content-text what-is-definition">
                    
                    <p>Specialized financial record-keeping, project-wise cost tracking, revenue recognition, and regulatory compliance for developers, builders, and contractors under RERA Act 2016 and Companies Act 2013. Goes beyond general bookkeeping to address escrow management, POCM accounting, and RERA-mandated audit certificates.</p>
                    <p>For Gurugram developers on Dwarka Expressway or New Gurugram: each project is a separate cost centre with escrow accounts per HRERA, revenue per Ind AS 115, and GST at applicable rates. For <a href="/statutory-audit">Statutory Audit</a>, see our page.</p>
                    <p>A CA with real estate expertise ensures financial statements reflect each project's true position while satisfying RERA, Companies Act, and Income Tax simultaneously. For <a href="/tds-return-filing-24q">TDS Return Filing</a>, see our page.</p>

